失、篡改。\n4. 配套配饰：图2家电附带的原装配件、装饰件、置物配件、挂饰等配套物品，完整迁移至图1场景，样式、位置、比例保持不变。\n【光影适配（唯一可变量）】\n目标家电的明暗过渡、高光区域、阴影层次、机身反光、地面投影形状及边缘柔和度，严格遵循图1场景的光源方向、光照强度和环境色温。仅允许根据图1光照环境微调画面明度，色相、饱和度、固有色纹理保持锁定不变。\n【禁止项】\n1. 禁止更改目标家电的宽高比、机身形态、透视角度与空间比例；\n2. 禁止图1场景环境色、滤镜、氛围色侵染家电固有色彩与材质；\n3. 禁止模糊、扭曲、拉伸、重绘家电机身纹理与精细工艺细节；\n4. 禁止保留、残留图1原有家电的任何配饰、纹理与局部特征。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false, "disabled": false}, "type": "JjkText", "title": "家电指令", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [397.1047058105469, 291.45196533203125], "pos": [3323.554443359375, 3089.977294921875], "id": 225, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [354, 355, 440], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["", "1k", "low", "3:4", false, 962693424, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 448, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 436, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": 